    "title": "Elyria Taco Mike food truck closes permanently - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By The Chronicle-Telegram ,\n5 hours ago Taco Mike, a popular food truck in Elyria, announced Tuesday that it has permanently closed. “Taco Mike has consumed our lives for 11 years with us missing out on many family and friend gatherings,” the business said in a Facebook post. “For those of you in the food truck business you know the many long hours and weekends worked.” Read full article\n6",
